{"msg":"操作成功!","data":{"guideTitle":"与相印宝、喵喵机错题本打印文档操作手册","guideId":16,"guideContent":"<div class=\"text-blue mb-32\">需要搭配硬件“相印宝”、“喵喵机”打印使用</div>\n        <div class=\"mb-32\">第一步：到应用商城搜索“相印宝”、“喵喵机”，并注册登录，按说明书连接打印机</div>\n        <div class=\"mb-32\">第二步：错题本选题打印生成文档</div>\n        <img\n          class=\"img\"\n          src=\"https://k12-swift.xunfeixxj.com/xxjserver/help/thermalPrint/pic_1_20210825.jpg\"\n          alt=\"\"\n        />\n        <img\n          class=\"img\"\n          src=\"https://k12-swift.xunfeixxj.com/xxjserver/help/thermalPrint/pic_2_20210825.jpg\"\n          alt=\"\"\n        />\n        <div class=\"mb-32\">\n          第三步：在App中选择文档打印<br />\n          1.相印宝：选择首页-设备-文档打印\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flexspacebetween mb-32\">\n          <img\n            class=\"img-l\"\n            src=\"https://k12-swift.xunfeixxj.com/xxjserver/help/thermalPrint/pic_3_20210825.jpg\"\n            alt=\"\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"img-r\"\n            src=\"https://k12-swift.xunfeixxj.com/xxjserver/help/thermalPrint/pic_4_20210825.jpg\"\n            alt=\"\"\n          />\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"mb-32\">2.喵喵机：在百宝箱-更多-文档打印</div>\n        <div class=\"flexspacebetween\">\n          <img\n            class=\"img-l\"\n            src=\"https://k12-swift.xunfeixxj.com/xxjserver/help/thermalPrint/pic_5_20210825.jpg\"\n            alt=\"\"\n          />\n          <img\n            class=\"img-r\"\n            src=\"https://k12-swift.xunfeixxj.com/xxjserver/help/thermalPrint/pic_6_20210825.jpg\"\n            alt=\"\"\n          />\n        </div>"},"status":0}